.SH EXAMPLES
One vulnerable\->fixed pair per ecosystem (Python).
.SS Python
\fIVulnerable:\fR
.RS
.EX
os.chmod(secret, 0o777)            # world-readable/writable
.EE
.RE
\fIFixed:\fR
.RS
.EX
os.chmod(secret, 0o600)            # owner only
.EE
.RE
